  propose the following: Height: 48 Storeys (149 metres) Number of Dwelling
  Units: 2\,424 Parking Spaces: 1\,631 Visitor parking: 242 Bike parking: 1
 \,819 The application also proposes a 1\,854.7 square metre parkland dedic
 ation and a 2\,362 square metre conveyance along East Highland Creek. Join
